    "title": "Guns N' Roses concert at Morton Amphitheater delayed due to weather - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jaiyda Tyler ,\n5 hours ago KANSAS CITY, Mo. — Fans will have to wait a bit longer to enjoy the sweet sounds of Guns N’ Roses for their first concert at Riverside’s Morton Amphitheater. Storms have continued to sweep across the Kansas City metro and beyond leaving behind significant damage in many neighborhoods. Now, storms are putting a hold on tonight’s Guns N’ Roses concert. Read full article\n3",
